[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3786.63, "timestamp": "01:03:06", "text": "呃，你把它别上去了吗？哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3788.39, "timestamp": "01:03:08", "text": "我错过了其中两个，但它们都在最后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3789.99, "timestamp": "01:03:09", "text": "我没有剪辑视频，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3793.43, "timestamp": "01:03:13", "text": "他们没数，我说好吧，数一数。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3795.589, "timestamp": "01:03:15", "text": "接近100%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3798.71, "timestamp": "01:03:18", "text": "我想，既然我当时也是这样，那情况就和……一样了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3801.67, "timestamp": "01:03:21", "text": "摩登城市。我也提前升职了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3803.349, "timestamp": "01:03:23", "text": "好的，还没到时候。它将位于顶部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3804.589, "timestamp": "01:03:24", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3812.43, "timestamp": "01:03:32", "text": "那。渗透任务可以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3814.43, "timestamp": "01:03:34", "text": "重做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3817.029, "timestamp": "01:03:37", "text": "什么？浸润？我没有收集"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3826.95, "timestamp": "01:03:46", "text": "我只会想念那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3833.589, "timestamp": "01:03:53", "text": "使命。打断了随机的祈祷。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3835.43, "timestamp": "01:03:55", "text": "显露真身。这根本不行"}]